{
  "_readme": "Manual overrides for overview sections. Keys in 'sections' must match trainer_parties.h comment titles exactly (e.g. 'Silph Co. 2F' from parent+floor headers). mapToken is the MAP_* suffix from data/maps/*/map.json id field (e.g. MAP_SILPH_CO_2F -> SILPH_CO_2F). Tile images fall back to graphics/map_preview/<tileset>/tiles.png when missing from data/tilesets/. crop uses 0.0-1.0 fractions of layout width/height. mapScaleMax is optional 0.0-1.0 multiplier on the fitted map size (1.0 = fill available space; 0.75 = 75% of that). fullHeight scales the map up to the --map-full-height (900px) when width allows. stretchedHeight is an optional multiplier of --map-full-height (e.g. 2.0 = 1800px, 1.5 = 1350px) for extremely long maps. hideEncounters (default false) hides wild encounters: set true to drop all encounters, or an array of group keys to hide specific ones (accepted: 'land_mons', 'rock_smash_mons', 'water_mons', 'fishing_mons'). hideItems (default false) hides item pickups: set true to drop all items, or an array of item indices to hide specific rendered entries (e.g. [0] hides the first item that would render). hideMoveTutors (default false) hides move tutor rows: set true to drop all tutors, or an array of tutor indices to hide specific rendered entries (e.g. [0] hides the first tutor row that would render). itemMapTokens (optional array) adds item/gift aggregation from extra map tokens into this section. manualItems (optional array) adds explicit entries for flag-based or special acquisitions (supports itemToken, itemName, iconPath, palettePath, quantity, isHidden). manualShops (optional array) adds explicit shop cards (supports locationLabel, shopLabel, variantLabel, currency, theme, offers[] with name/cost/currency). merges combines multiple comment-sections into one overview section.",
